{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02532","headline":"奉和圣制春日望海 · 杨师道","name":"奉和圣制春日望海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春山临渤海，征旅辍晨装。\n回瞰卢龙塞，斜瞻肃慎乡。\n洪波回地轴，孤屿映云光。\n落日惊涛上，浮天骇浪长。\n仙台隐螭驾，水府泛鼋梁。\n碣石朝烟灭，之罘归雁翔。\n北巡非汉后，东幸异秦皇。\n搴旗羽林客，跋距少年场。\n龙击驱辽水，鹏飞出带方。\n将举青丘缴，安访白霓裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨师道","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02532.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02532","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}